y at Johns Hopkins University. Her research explores cancer care and history of the body in the United States and Mexico. An avid reader and writer, Sarah holds an MFA in Creative Writing from University of Notre Dame. She is ... \",\"title\":\"https://medicalhealthhumanities.com/writers/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dissertation\\n\\nAlongside your four modules, you also get the chance to pursue your own distinct research interests in the dissertation (16,000 words). This is an opportunity to develop a new idea from one of your modules into something longer. Alternatively, you could write on a subject or ... \",\"title\":\"https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/arts/english/postgraduatestudies/critical-cultural-theory/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\"},\"ref\":\"d87\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sarah Robbins, Assistant Professor of Early American Multi-Ethnic Literature, completed a PhD in English at Yale University in 2021. Her research focus is in nineteenth-century African American literature, and her current book project, based on her dissertation, Re(-)Markable Texts: Making Meaning of Revision in 19th ... \",\"title\":\"https://as.tufts.edu/english/news-events/news/new-english-department-faculty-2022\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d88\"},\"ref\":\"d88\",\"snippet\":\" ... Recent PhD Dissertations\\ndate: 2023-04-01\\n---\\nMenu\\n\\nParallel Members – Parallelism, Translation and Sacred Poetry, 1741-1929\\n\\nMárton Farkas\\n\\nSanitizing Narratives: Urban Health in Nineteenth-Century European Fiction\\n\\nJacob Meister\\n\\nThe Parascientific Method: Thresholds of History in and beyond Contemporary Chinese Science Fiction\\n\\nMichael O'Krent\\n\\nEducational Encounters ... \",\"title\":\"https://complit.fas.harvard.edu/phd-dissertations/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d89\"},\"ref\":\"d89\",\"snippet\":\" ... PhD LCS Dissertations - Department of English - Dietrich College of Humanities and Social Sciences\\ndate: 2025-01-01\\n---\\nYear\\n\\n|\\n\\nGraduate\\n\\n|\\n\\nDissertation\\n\\n|\\n\\n| 2024 |\\n\\nRobyn Rowley |\\n\\nLaughing With the Medusas: Feminist Politics in the Age of Media Transformation |\\n\\n|\\n\\nPearl Nielsen |\\n\\nDecolonizing the Medical Encounter: Restorative Ethics of Care and Cared-For ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cmu.edu/dietrich/english/academic-programs/phd-lcs/phd-lcs-dissertations.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d90\"},\"ref\":\"d90\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is a Senior Lecturer in the Expository Writing Program at New York University. -\\n\\nSarah Wheeler\\n\\nSarah Wheeler\\n\\nSarah Wheeler has been a teacher for 25 years and is currently English Department Chair at Rhinebeck High School in Rhinebeck, NY. She studied French and Italian literature at Columbia ... \",\"title\":\"https://languageandthinking.bard.edu/faculty/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"a4bcbc908ba3f8380e0751202680a17adfd7e5c217cdfe5a1f23b48a2f1507a0\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"29d1223409f4f6add9243c73d06bc67ebb31c6b7caf0ecdc3151a9bf6a1e4706\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Sarah Hatchuel PhD dissertation Shakespeare writings\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Université Paul-Valéry Montpellier 3, site Saint Charles, France\\n\\nConference coordinators: Sarah Hatchuel (GRIC, EA 4314, Université Le Havre Normandie) and Nathalie Vienne-Guerrin (IRCL, UMR5186, CNRS/ Université Paul-Valéry Montpellier 3)\\n\\nAdvisory board:\\n\\nSylvaine Bataille, Université de Rouen Normandie, France; Victoria Bladen, University of Queensland, Australia; Claire ... \",\"title\":\"https://essenglish.org/cfp/conf1909/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d91\"},\"ref\":\"d91\",\"snippet\":\" ... At the Tourneville fort, high above the docks, some two hundred people turned out in March for a lecture organized by the Havre Center for Historical Research and given by an academic from the Université Le Havre Normandie, Thomas Vaisset, on the official management of corpses and body ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nybooks.com/articles/2024/06/20/d-days-forgotten-victims-speak-out-forgotten-blitzes/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d92\"},\"ref\":\"d92\",\"snippet\":\" ... In April 1843, she gave birth to twin girls to a \\\"father unknown.\\\" Both girls died in the hospice in Le Havre a month later. The following year, Youle was pregnant again, this time with Sarah. She moved to Paris, to 5 rue de l'École-de-Médecine ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Bernhardt\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\" ... Such contemporary expressions are interrogated in Finnish director Aki Kaurismäki's 2011 French language film Le Havre, which engages dystopian tropes and conventions, spatialising multiple temporalities to historicise contemporary questions about migration. Le Havre tells the story of teenager Idrissa, who evades police after arriving in the city ... \",\"title\":\"https://c21.openlibhums.org/article/id/9350/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\" ... He joined Le Havre in 2010, turning down offers from leading French teams Paris Saint-Germain and Marseille to join them, being enticed by Le Havre's youth system. He initially played for their reserve team, Le Havre II, before going on to play 60 times and score ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riyad_Mahrez\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... Industry and trade at the Port of Le Havre\\n\\nAlthough Impression, Sunrise was neither Monet's first, nor his only painting to feature Le Havre, it captures a period of growth for the port, indicative of France's participation in global trade and commerce. In the 18th century ... \",\"title\":\"https://smarthistory.org/claude-monets-impression-sunrise/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... Restaurant du Havre\\n\\n109, Rue St.-Lazare\\n\\n2nd arrondissement\\n\\nRestaurant du Havre was located adjacent to a covered shopping arcade called the Passage du Havre, and near the Gare St. Lazare, the large railway station where Americans typically arrived and departed on the Le Havre-Paris boat train ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theamericanmenu.com/2024/09/americans-in-paris-roaring-20s.htm