ead a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"d4fbee1392c3ce8585b42265b96754668845fb5279757869282156599e7f5dd4\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"c2844f2073f08261fccc4bdac624af055cbbbef079715abb1264f49f9deac0fc\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Sarah Hatchuel PhD dissertation Shakespeare\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_0135b90b986d4c93971745dd"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and all-page cleanup are optional.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"RESEARCH\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":187,\"backend_calls\":89,\"model_calls\":9,\"output_reservation\":46986},\"research_workflow\":{\"active_gap_not_verified\":null,\"available_pages_not_ranked_for_relevance\":[{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d115\"},\"ref\":\"d115\",\"snippet\":\" ... However, the dissertation enhancement grant does not support fundamental dissertation research. For this reason, preference will be given to PhD candidates\",\"title\":\"https://gradschool.vanderbilt.edu/student-resources/professional-development/gli/gli-funding-opportunities/\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d114\"},\"ref\":\"d114\",\"snippet\":\" ... The same year, the name of the club changed for Havre Athletic Club. The association football code received definitively the members adhesion in 1894. From\",\"title\":\"https://www.rsssf.org/tablesf/franchamp.